	| Partner/Reseller/SI Accounts | 0                             |
	| First Line Support Accounts  | 0                             |
	When I click on the "Korpar - ${staticProjectName}" team link
	And I click on the "Partner/Reseller/SI Accounts" tab
	Then I should not be able to view an account on the team details page with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}"
	When I click on the "First Line Support Accounts" tab
	Then I should not be able to view an account on the team details page with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}"
	When I go to the account index page
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Korpro"
	Then I should be able to view an account on the provisioning index with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" and the following values
	| Name    | Korpro - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Code    | PROKORKORPRO                  |
	| Partner | -                             |
	| Region  | United States                 |
	| SLA     | Platinum                      |
	| Tier    | T4                            |
	| State   | ACTIVE                        |